{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106020","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1410602001:0":{"text":"People of the realm, cast your condemning gaze upon these wretched souls!","source_cn":"诸位，尽情用你们的目光谴责这些罪人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE6C207903678B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410602002:0":{"text":"Were it not for Her Majesty's boundless grace, how could these lowly commoners have been blessed with such divine favor?","source_cn":"若不是女王陛下垂怜，这些平民怎能蒙受至高的恩典？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BC392C30E83D29B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410602003:0":{"text":"Yet, when the winds of hardship blew, they lost their way, turning their backs on the merciful Queen.","source_cn":"然而，面对稍许风雨扬起的尘沙时，他们竟在其中迷失方向，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B120C5E6836BC75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410602004:0":{"text":"What sacrilege, what insolence! By the Queen's name, I shall decree death upon all who are irredeemable.","source_cn":"这是何等的亵渎，何等的冒犯！在此，我将以女王之名，对所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26ACFFFDA62ADB8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410602005:1":{"text":"You can't possibly mean every single commoner here, can you?","source_cn":"所有……？你该不会是指，在场的所有平民吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD68BE5D4B9C88D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410602006:0":{"text":"Some were merely swept up in the chaos of this unrest. They've done nothing wrong. If only we could carefully discern...","source_cn":"有些人是被裹挟入此次骚乱的，这些人什么都没有做。若能详...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFA9E931723F97D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410602007:1":{"text":"Ravion, I admit you have inherited Her Majesty's merciful heart.","source_cn":"沙利叶，我承认，你继承了女王那慈悲的心肠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F3F7994FA6263AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410602008:0":{"text":"However, a high-ranking priest has gone missing during this riot, and it's highly likely that these savages have torn him to pieces.","source_cn":"但是，一位高阶祭司在这场暴乱中消失了，他很可能已经被这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11022BBF9B9C994D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410602009:0":{"text":"You always look on the dark side. He could have simply been frightened and hidden away.","source_cn":"你总是把一切往坏处想，他也可能只是吓得躲起来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5C53BAA3D8CF6EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410602010:0":{"text":"Ravion, I beseech you to stop defending these sinners.","source_cn":"不要再为这些罪人辩解了，沙利叶！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5880991772158C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410602011:1":{"text":"High Priestess!","source_cn":"冕下！奎茵冕下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC01E13997FC7D756","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410602012:0":{"text":"Feli?","source_cn":"斐利尔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFE56CC27DB6604","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410602013:0":{"text":"What did I just say? Look at him—he's perfectly fine!","source_cn":"就是他？我说什么来着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE418114BD34219A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410602014:1":{"text":"...\nFeli, my dear, thank the Queen for your safety.","source_cn":"……\\n亲爱的斐利尔，太好了，女王保佑，你平安无事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD002E2871820A6FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410602015:0":{"text":"You vanished amidst the turmoil, and I had many sent to find you, but there was no news. I feared the worst.","source_cn":"你在暴乱之中失去了踪迹，我派了许多人去找你，但一直毫无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAC36CCC3DA03EFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410602016:0":{"text":"I'm sorry... I just got lost. I didn't mean to worry you.","source_cn":"抱歉，我、我只是……一时迷了路，让您担心了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5587AE06FBE0C490","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410602017:0":{"text":"To be lost is no matter of great consequence, dear child. As long as we hold the grace Her Majesty has bestowed upon us in our hearts, we will find our way back.","source_cn":"迷路不可怕，只要牢记女王陛下赐予的恩典，我们终将会回到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BD923A6A794443D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410602018:0":{"text":"Thank you, High Priestess. Now that I'm back, could you spare these innocent commoners?","source_cn":"谢谢您，冕下。但您能否饶过这些无辜的人？您看，我没事，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93F0E222E1245B34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410602019:0":{"text":"Shh... I know you are a kind and merciful child, quick to forgive their transgressions. But do you understand the gravity of their deeds?","source_cn":"嘘……我知道你是个善良的孩子，你如此轻易地宽容了他们的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91450B0D808A6CEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410602020:0":{"text":"Deeds... what do you mean?","source_cn":"做……做了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFBC452D42AB3F79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410602021:0":{"text":"Those wretches seized a considerable amount of the Divine Dew entrusted to us and distributed it among the greedy commoners.","source_cn":"那些恶徒从我们手中抢走了大量恩典灵露，分给贪婪索取的平民们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75125A637F9BA8D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410602022:1":{"text":"The \"innocent\" ones you speak of accepted these gifts without the slightest qualm, gifts that they were never entitled to.","source_cn":"你口中的无辜之人，心安理得地接受了这些不应属于他们的馈赠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x936770B24803E972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410602023:0":{"text":"The situation was chaotic at the time; taking some Divine Dew hardly seems like a grave offense, does it?","source_cn":"当时局势混乱，抢走几瓶恩典灵露算不上什么大事吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE375AA8E029EFDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410602024:1":{"text":"Ravion, the Divine Dew is not easily obtained. Please cease defending these marauders.","source_cn":"沙利叶！至高的恩典得来不易，你休得一再替暴徒狡辩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C114C63701C305D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410602025:0":{"text":"Her Majesty has borne much alone in her effort to bestow us with her compassionate grace. Mercy will only embolden them further!","source_cn":"为了给予我们慈爱的恩典，女王独自承受了太多！宽容只会被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363BBE7AB3525884","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410602026:1":{"text":"But... what exactly has Her Majesty endured?","source_cn":"可是……女王她，究竟承受了什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6038293369C52FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410602027:0":{"text":"Hmm?","source_cn":"嗯……？<key:dialog41>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E912766F040572","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410602028:0":{"text":"The Divine Dew isn't even Her Majesty's power...","source_cn":"因为……恩典灵露，其实……并不是女王的力量……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AF5EBF0E6BB8BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410602029:0":{"text":"It's from dragon eggs, isn't it?","source_cn":"恩典灵露，不是源于龙蛋吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE262F860E38C3694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1410602030:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410602031:0":{"text":"Feli, I beg your pardon?","source_cn":"斐利尔，你说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x606F48982F861927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410602032:0":{"text":"The Divine Dew came from the dragon eggs.","source_cn":"龙蛋。恩典灵露其实是龙蛋的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1FC2AB05D5D7AE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1410602033:0":{"text":"Nonsense!","source_cn":"住口！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B3B81C30A7C6DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1410602034:0":{"text":"I'm speaking the truth! I saw it with my own eyes!","source_cn":"可我看到了！是真的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49B42510FBBF75EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1410602035:0":{"text":"Cease these lies, Feli!","source_cn":"斐利尔……你在撒谎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x743B90CD456FDFF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奎茵":{"text":"Velara","source":"奎茵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:沙利叶":{"text":"Ravion","source":"沙利叶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斐利尔":{"text":"Feli","source":"斐利尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":36,"localized_text_count":35,"speaker_count":3}}